      "diff": "@@ -22,15 +22,17 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n // The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2025-04[] {notable}\n-// Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n-// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n-// cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n-// Fixed in master: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.4: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.2: xxx\n+* wssalink:2025-04[] {notable}\n+MONGO dissector infinite loop.\n+wsbuglink:20724[].\n+cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: 1ec4709cab\n+// Fixed in release-4.6: fdb3823962\n+// Fixed in release-4.4: ac504cd5de\n+// Fixed in release-4.2: 513e5d4972\n // CVSS AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\n-// CWE-824\n+// CWE-835\n+// * Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-09-22-11446760871.pcap. wsbuglink:20724[].\n \n The following bugs have been fixed:\n \n@@ -40,6 +42,14 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark took a bite out of each of your freshly baked muffins until it found the perfect one. {notable}\n \n+* Using wslog parameters in command line applications leads to freeing invalid memory. wsbuglink:20500[].\n+* On macOS a lower resolution Wireshark icon is displayed in the App Switcher and Launchpad. wsbuglink:20544[]. {notable}\n+// misdissection, but no crash.\n+* Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-08-06-10932469456.pcap. wsbuglink:20666[].\n+* Encoding on NAS5GS- NASDL Transport Message-Multiple Container contains inconsistencies. wsbuglink:20679[]. {notable}\n+* Bad resolver in Delegated Credential (RFC 9345) of TLS 1.3 CertificateRequest message. wsbuglink:20728[]. {notable}\n+* Fuzz job UTF-8 encoding issue: fuzz-2025-10-03-11586692659.pcap. wsbuglink:20744[].\n+\n // == Known Bugs\n \n === New and Updated Features\n@@ -55,9 +65,20 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.4.9.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.4.10.. | rg packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+CFM\n+CQL\n+DOF\n+H.248E\n+IEEE 802.11\n+HTTP2\n+IAX2\n+LTP\n+MONGO\n+NAS-5GS\n+XML\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
